PROGRAMMING STYLES, PROJECT MILESTONE 1 (INTRO TO BEAUTIFULSOUP)

HOW TO RUN:
Unzip the files and run each task individually using command line:
python <task.py> <input.html>
(Every task needs an input .html file to run)
Tasks 1, 6, 7 write to an output file called "prettified.py" (to not mess with the input file)

Performance on large files (encoded to bin to save CPU overhead):
Stress tested using a 100 MB file, html.parser took forever, lxml took ~20 seconds.
Tested using a 1 GB file, lxml took ~400 seconds and filled up the memory.